id: pm-brief-toolchain-1104
title: Adapt brief host contracts to the November 4 toolchain
description: "Verify current failures on the newest pm toolchain for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/204. Prior completed migrations remain closed; preserve all assertions and thresholds."
